  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 810031e0539baf849a8ec048a6ff4b7a, type: 3}
  m_Name: help_building
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_building
  displayName: Building
  order: 200
  category: Building
  icon: tool_build
  body: 'Press {Build} and pick a building in the palette ({Previous} / {Next} go through it, {Rotate} turns it). A green preview means it fits; red means it doesn''t, and the info panel says why.


    The cost comes out of your stock when you place it, and a see-through blueprint appears. Workers walk over and build it. Removing a building (right mouse) gives its cost back.


    Belts, lifts and other small buildings need open space ants can walk on. Machines need dug-out space underground with a flat, solid floor under their whole width.


    Locked buildings are faded in the palette: research unlocks them. Point at one to see what it does and costs.'
  reveal: 0
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
